# Several audio tracks and codecs: one MPEG-TS elementary stream per track; track index selects the stream; PIDs follow stream
# creation order (video first); packets of a track whose stream does not exist are ignored (not tested: precondition).
create
world tracks 2
start
pkt v 0 0 0 1 3000
pkt a 0 0 0 1 200
pkt a 1 0 0 1 300
pkt v 0 1 1 0 800
pkt a 0 1024 1024 1 200
pkt a 1 1024 1024 1 300
drain
stop 0
events
ts
destroy
